it is not the case you are right. You can choose to apply redirection effects pre modifiers (like driving mantis) but not with damage/healing conversion. For AZ damage needs to &quot;go through&quot; to get the healing so all modifiers must be accounted for. OoO ruling only applies to simultaneous triggers/effects
